(TAP) SHRAPNEL VORTEX
<br/>Creates a slashing, staggering swirl of shrapnel.

(HOLD) SHIELD SATELLITES
<br/>Protea reconfigures Grenades to work as overcharging shield generators, protecting her, her allies and companions. When Shields break, a Satellite is destroyed to double minimum Shield Gate invincibility time.
